    description: "Exclusive Newly Built Villa with Private Pool in Benissa Costa\n\nDiscover this stunning newly built villa located in one of the most sought-after areas of Benissa Costa. Designed in a contemporary style, this exceptional property combines modern architecture, comfort, and high-quality finishes, offering the perfect Mediterranean lifestyle.\n\nThe villa offers 190 m² of built area on a 640 m² plot, with bright, spacious interiors and beautifully designed outdoor living areas.\n\nThe main floor features a spacious open-plan living and dining area with a modern fully equipped kitchen. Large floor-to-ceiling windows provide plenty of natural light and direct access to the terrace, private swimming pool, and the fully equipped summer kitchen, creating the ideal space for relaxing or entertaining family and friends.\n\nThis level also includes three generous bedrooms and three stylish bathrooms, all finished to a high standard.\n\nThe lower floor offers a versatile independent living area comprising a second lounge, kitchen, games room, one bedroom, and one bathroom. This space is perfect for guests, extended family, or can easily be adapted as a self-contained apartment.\n\nFeatures\n\nNewly built contemporary villa190 m² built area640 m² plotPrivate swimming poolSummer kitchen and spacious terraces4 bedrooms4 bathroomsOpen-plan living and dining areaDucted air conditioningCentral heatingPrivate garageElectric vehicle charging pointHigh-quality materials and finishes\n\nIdeally located in the prestigious Benissa Costa area, the property is just minutes from beautiful beaches and coves, restaurants, supermarkets, golf courses, marinas, and all essential amenities.\n\nWhether you are looking for a permanent residence, a holiday home, or an excellent investment opportunity on the Costa Blanca, this outstanding villa offers everything you need.\n\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a private viewing.",
