    description: "Exceptional Modern Living on the Costa Blanca\n\nPositioned in one of the Costa Blanca's most coveted residential settings, this outstanding property for sale in Cumbre del Sol Costa Blanca combines refined contemporary architecture with breathtaking panoramic views across the Mediterranean coastline. Completed in 2020, the villa enjoys an enviable south-facing orientation, capturing sunlight throughout the day while showcasing uninterrupted vistas stretching along the Benitachell coastline towards the iconic Peñón de Ifach.\n\nDesigned to embrace both the scenery and the Mediterranean climate, the residence offers generous interior proportions, seamless indoor-outdoor living and beautifully landscaped surroundings. Every principal room has been carefully arranged to maximise natural light and connect effortlessly with the spectacular coastal backdrop, creating a home that feels equally suited to permanent living, entertaining or luxurious holidays.\n\nThoughtfully Designed Contemporary Interiors\n\nThe upper floor forms the heart of the home, where an impressive open-plan living environment brings together elegant lounge and dining areas alongside a sleek, fully equipped contemporary kitchen. Expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing allows the Mediterranean to become part of the interior, opening directly onto the spacious south-facing terrace where the swimming pool appears to merge with the endless sea beyond.\n\nAccommodation on this level includes three generous double bedrooms and two stylish bathrooms. The principal suite enjoys a privileged position, offering captivating sea views and direct access to the pool terrace, creating a peaceful retreat to wake up to each morning. A guest cloakroom adds further convenience for residents and visitors alike.\n\nIndependent Guest Accommodation\n\nThe lower level has been thoughtfully arranged as a spacious self-contained guest apartment, providing excellent flexibility for visiting family, friends or extended stays. Designed with the same contemporary aesthetic as the main residence, it features an open-plan living area with a modern fitted kitchen alongside two spacious double bedrooms, each benefiting from its own en-suite bathroom.\n\nThis independent accommodation enhances the versatility of the villa while maintaining privacy for both owners and guests.\n\nOutdoor Spaces Designed for Mediterranean Living\n\nThe exterior of this luxury property in Cumbre del Sol has been created with low-maintenance living in mind. Professionally landscaped gardens frame the villa beautifully, while multiple terraces provide a choice of sun-drenched and shaded areas from which to admire the remarkable coastal panorama.\n\nThe private swimming pool forms the focal point of the outdoor living spaces, perfectly positioned to enjoy the exceptional sea views. Within the secure plot, a covered parking area comfortably accommodates two vehicles.\n\nWhether enjoying peaceful mornings overlooking the Mediterranean or hosting guests on warm summer evenings, the outdoor environment has been designed to make the very most of this exceptional location.\n\nProperty Features\n\nFive-bedroom contemporary villa\n\nConstructed in 2020, Energy Rating A\n\nPanoramic Mediterranean and Peñón de Ifach sea views\n\nPrivate south-facing swimming pool\n\nIndependent two-bedroom guest apartment\n\nFloor-to-ceiling windows throughout the living areas\n\nProfessionally landscaped low-maintenance gardens\n\nCovered parking for two vehicles\n\nMultiple sea-view terraces\n\nLocated in the prestigious residential community of Cumbre del Sol\n\nCumbre del Sol, Coastal Living with Mediterranean Views\n\nSet between the highly desirable coastal towns of Moraira and Jávea, Cumbre del Sol is one of the most prestigious residential communities on the Costa Blanca North. Elevated above the Mediterranean, it is renowned for its dramatic coastline, spectacular sea views and tranquil atmosphere, making it a sought-after destination for international buyers searching for premium real estate in Cumbre del Sol.\n\nResidents enjoy access to picturesque coves, scenic coastal walking routes, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and one of the region's leading international schools. Daily shopping is convenient with two large supermarkets approximately seven to eight minutes away by car, while the wider selection of boutiques, restaurants and services in both Moraira and Benitachell can be reached in around ten minutes. Combining natural beauty with excellent everyday amenities, Cumbre del Sol offers an exceptional setting for those seeking a villa for sale in Cumbre del Sol and an outstanding Mediterranean lifestyle.",
