    description: "Future-Focused Luxury Villa for Sale in Jávea\n\nA Contemporary Mediterranean Residence Designed Around Sustainability and Wellbeing\n\nArchitecture with a Purpose\n\nSome homes impress at first glance; others continue to reveal their value with every day spent within them. This exceptional contemporary villa in Jávea belongs firmly to the latter. Conceived with longevity, comfort and environmental responsibility in mind, it offers a refined interpretation of modern Mediterranean living where design and performance exist in perfect balance.\n\nOccupying a generous south-facing plot of 1,015 m², the property provides 476 m² of thoughtfully arranged accommodation across three levels. Sunlight fills the interiors throughout the day, while open spaces and a natural connection between indoors and out create an atmosphere that is both sophisticated and entirely liveable.\n\nFlexible Living for Every Chapter\n\nOne of the villa's most compelling attributes is its remarkable adaptability. The lower floor has intentionally been left as a blank canvas, presenting future owners with an opportunity to shape the home according to their individual lifestyle.\n\nWhether envisaged as additional en-suite guest accommodation, a private cinema, a wellness retreat, fitness studio, wine cellar or an entertainment lounge, the space offers exceptional versatility and the ability to evolve alongside changing family needs. It is a considered design decision that adds both practical and long-term value to the property.\n\nIntelligent Design and Exceptional Efficiency\n\nBeyond its striking contemporary architecture lies an advanced construction concept engineered to deliver superior comfort and impressively low running costs. Every aspect of the villa has been guided by three essential principles: outstanding insulation, airtight construction and the integration of renewable energy technologies.\n\nHigh-performance thermal insulation and a carefully engineered building envelope maintain a stable indoor climate throughout the year. The home remains pleasantly cool during the summer months and comfortably warm in winter, while significantly reducing energy consumption and enhancing overall wellbeing.\n\nAwarded an A+ Energy Rating, this is a residence that demonstrates how luxury and sustainability can coexist seamlessly.\n\nA New Standard of Mediterranean Living\n\nThe villa has been designed to meet the demands of contemporary living without compromising on elegance or comfort. Underfloor heating and cooling extend throughout the entire property, while an integrated system of twelve photovoltaic solar panels contributes to exceptional energy performance. There is also pre-installation for additional solar expansion and future pool heating, allowing the property to adapt to evolving technologies and owner preferences.\n\nAs a Nearly Zero Energy Building (NZEB), the home delivers remarkable efficiency and notably low maintenance and operating costs, making it as practical as it is visually compelling.\n\nThis is a property designed not simply for the present, but for generations to come—a residence where architectural quality, environmental awareness and Mediterranean living come together in complete harmony.\n\nProperty Features\n\nContemporary villa with 476 m² of accommodation across three levels\n\nSouth-facing plot of 1,015 m² in Jávea\n\nThree bedrooms and five bathrooms\n\nFlexible lower level offering extensive customisation potential\n\nA+ Energy Rating and Nearly Zero Energy Building performance\n\nUnderfloor heating and cooling throughout the property\n\nIntegrated package of twelve photovoltaic solar panels\n\nPre-installation for additional solar capacity and pool heating\n\nLocated between the Montgó Natural Park and Jávea's celebrated coastline\n\nConvenient access to the historic centre, marina, Arenal and year-round amenities\n\nLifestyle & Location\n\nFor those seeking a property for sale in Jávea, Costa Blanca, few destinations offer such a compelling blend of natural beauty and year-round lifestyle appeal. Situated between the Montgó Natural Park and a coastline renowned for its sandy beaches and dramatic coves, Jávea has become one of the most desirable addresses on the Costa Blanca North.\n\nThe town is defined by three distinct areas: the charming historic centre, the marina and port, and the vibrant Arenal beachfront, each offering its own atmosphere, restaurants and boutiques. An established international community, together with excellent schools, private healthcare and comprehensive amenities, makes Jávea equally appealing as a permanent residence or a second home destination.\n\nThe area's property landscape ranges from traditional Spanish homes to contemporary hillside villas overlooking the Mediterranean, particularly in sought-after locations such as Montgó, Cap Martí and Balcón al Mar.\n\nWith both Valencia and Alicante airports accessible in under an hour via the AP-7 motorway, this luxury property in Jávea combines effortless accessibility with an exceptional quality of life, making it an outstanding opportunity within the Costa Blanca real estate market.",
