    description: "Sea View Luxury Villa for Sale in Jávea, Costa Blanca\n\nA striking two-storey villa in Jávea with panoramic views towards the Mediterranean and Cape San Antonio. Set on a 1,000m² plot, the property combines five bedrooms, five bathrooms, an infinity pool and refined contemporary design, with the beach and new international school close by.\n\nThere are homes that respond simply to practical needs, and there are properties conceived around the quality of everyday living. This villa belongs firmly to the latter category. Across two floors, generous interiors, carefully selected materials and a light, contemporary aesthetic create a residence designed to feel both elegant and comfortable.\n\nIts defining quality is the relationship with its setting. From the property, views extend towards the sea and the distinctive profile of Cape San Antonio, bringing Jávea’s Mediterranean landscape into the experience of the home. The combination of architectural simplicity, natural materials and open views gives the villa a particularly composed character.\n\nScheduled for completion in December 2025, the residence offers the proportions and facilities sought by buyers considering a luxury property in Jávea, while its location adds an important practical dimension. The beach and the new international school are both described as being in the immediate vicinity, making the property relevant both as a private retreat and as a full-time residence.\n\nArchitecture with a Contemporary Mediterranean Character\n\nThe design balances modern luxury with a tactile use of materials. Exposed stone introduces texture and a sense of permanence, while timber elements soften the architectural palette and bring warmth to the interiors.\n\nThe result is modern without feeling overly formal. Bright, welcoming spaces are complemented by a sophisticated design language, creating an environment that can accommodate relaxed family life as comfortably as more considered entertaining.\n\nWith two storeys and five bedrooms, the villa provides substantial accommodation within a clearly defined architectural setting. Five bathrooms add further convenience, particularly for a home intended for family occupation or hosting guests.\n\nDesigned Around Outdoor Living\n\nThe infinity pool is one of the property's principal features, reinforcing the connection between the villa and its coastal surroundings. Its design complements the open outlook and creates an appealing focal point for time spent outdoors.\n\nFor buyers searching for a villa for sale in Jávea, the combination of sea views, private outdoor space and contemporary architecture is particularly compelling. The 1,000m² plot provides the setting for the residence, while the elevated visual relationship with the Mediterranean gives the property much of its character.\n\nRather than relying on unnecessary ornament, the villa's appeal comes from proportion, materials, natural light and the quality of its outlook. It is a considered approach to modern Costa Blanca living.\n\nA Prime Jávea Setting\n\nJávea, also known as Xàbia, is one of the Costa Blanca locations most closely associated with Mediterranean residential living. In this property, the setting is an integral part of the proposition, with direct views towards the sea and Cape San Antonio.\n\nThe proximity of the beach brings the coastline naturally into daily life, while the nearby new international school adds a practical consideration for families seeking a permanent home in the area. Together, these elements strengthen the property's appeal beyond its architectural qualities alone.\n\nFor those researching real estate in Jávea, this residence offers a concise combination of location, accommodation, design and outlook. It is equally suited to buyers seeking a sophisticated Costa Blanca base and those looking for a more substantial home in which to enjoy life in Jávea.\n\nProperty Features\n\nTwo-storey luxury villa in JáveaFive bedrooms and five bathrooms1,000m² plotInfinity swimming poolSea views towards Cape San AntonioContemporary, bright and welcoming interior designHigh-quality construction materialsExposed stone architectural detailingNatural timber elementsBeach in the immediate vicinityNew international school nearbyMediterranean setting on the Costa BlancaGenerous residential layoutModern luxury aestheticDesigned for comfortable family living and entertaining\n\nLiving in Jávea: Coastal Views and Everyday Convenience\n\nThe appeal of this property lies in the way its individual qualities come together. The sea view establishes an immediate sense of place, while the outlook towards Cape San Antonio provides a distinctive visual identity that is closely connected to Jávea.\n\nInside, the emphasis is on light, comfort and understated refinement. Exposed stone and timber introduce contrasting textures, while the contemporary design keeps the overall atmosphere bright and welcoming. Five bedrooms and five bathrooms make the accommodation particularly well suited to buyers who value space and flexibility.\n\nOutside, the infinity pool provides a natural centrepiece for Mediterranean living. Whether used as a quiet place to unwind or as part of a more social setting, it complements the villa's relationship with its coastal environment.\n\nLocation is equally significant. With the beach and new international school nearby, the property combines the atmosphere associated with a Costa Blanca lifestyle with access to two highly relevant everyday destinations. No additional assumptions about travel times or local facilities are required to appreciate the convenience of the setting.\n\nFor discerning buyers exploring a property for sale in Jávea, this villa presents a balanced proposition: substantial accommodation, five bathrooms, a 1,000m² plot, contemporary luxury design, an infinity pool and an exceptional sea-facing outlook. Its architectural character is strengthened by the use of exposed stone and timber, while its position places the Mediterranean firmly at the centre of the living experience.\n\nThe villa therefore offers more than a collection of specifications. It is a residence shaped around light, views, modern comfort and the distinctive coastal setting of Jávea. For buyers seeking a villa for sale in Jávea Costa Blanca, it represents an elegant interpretation of contemporary Mediterranean living.",
