    description: "Villa for Sale in Paichi Moraira with a Rare Flat Plot and Private Pool\n\nFive-bedroom villa for sale in Paichi, Moraira, occupying a rare, almost flat plot of over 1,200m². Featuring spacious accommodation across two floors, a private swimming pool, multiple terraces, generous parking and an excellent location just minutes from Moraira's beaches, marina and town centre.\n\nSituated within the peaceful residential neighbourhood of Paichi, this attractive property for sale in Moraira Costa Blanca offers an increasingly rare combination of generous outdoor space, versatile accommodation and a highly convenient location. Just a short drive from the heart of Moraira, the marina and Playa de l'Ampolla, it provides the ideal setting for enjoying everyday life on the Costa Blanca.\n\nOccupying an impressive plot of more than 1,200m², the villa enjoys the benefit of largely level gardens, creating an accessible and practical environment that is difficult to find in this sought-after area. Whether as a full-time residence, a spacious family holiday home or an investment within the thriving real estate in Moraira market, the property offers outstanding flexibility for a variety of lifestyles.\n\nSpacious Living Designed Across Two Levels\n\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully arranged over two floors, creating comfortable living spaces with a natural separation between family and guest accommodation.\n\nThe main level centres around a welcoming living room that provides easy access throughout the home. Adjacent is a generously proportioned open-plan kitchen, fully equipped and complemented by a practical storage room, making everyday living both convenient and functional.\n\nThis floor also accommodates three well-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a principal bedroom with its own en-suite bathroom. One of the bedrooms enjoys access to a private elevated terrace overlooking the pool area, providing a peaceful retreat for morning coffee or quiet relaxation.\n\nUpper Floor Offering Flexible Family Accommodation\n\nA distinctive spiral staircase leads to the upper floor where an inviting living and dining room, complete with fireplace, creates an ideal setting throughout every season.\n\nLarge doors connect the interior with a covered terrace and an expansive outdoor seating area where open views can be enjoyed throughout the day. The elevated position offers an ideal space for al fresco dining, entertaining guests or simply appreciating Moraira's renowned Mediterranean climate.\n\nCompleting this level are two further double bedrooms together with an additional family bathroom, making the upper floor perfectly suited for visiting family, older children or long-stay guests seeking additional privacy.\n\nExceptional Outdoor Living\n\nOutdoor living is one of this villa's defining strengths. The generous plot allows the house to sit comfortably within beautifully proportioned gardens, providing privacy without sacrificing openness.\n\nAt the centre lies the private kidney-shaped swimming pool, surrounded by spacious sun terraces that offer numerous places to unwind throughout the day. Whether relaxing beside the pool, hosting summer lunches or enjoying evenings outdoors, the layout has been designed to make the most of the Mediterranean lifestyle.\n\nThe low-maintenance landscaping ensures the gardens remain attractive throughout the year while requiring minimal upkeep. Several terraces positioned around the property provide both sunny and shaded seating areas, allowing owners to enjoy different aspects of the home from morning until sunset.\n\nAdding further practicality are two independent vehicle entrances together with extensive parking for multiple cars, an increasingly valuable feature for larger families or those who frequently entertain visitors.\n\nA Rare Opportunity Close to Moraira\n\nFinding a villa for sale in Paichi with such a substantial, almost level plot is becoming increasingly uncommon. Combined with its five-bedroom accommodation, practical layout and close proximity to Moraira's beaches, restaurants, marina and everyday amenities, the property presents an excellent opportunity within one of the Costa Blanca's most established residential areas.\n\nFor buyers searching for a property in Moraira that offers space, privacy and future potential without compromising accessibility to the town centre, this residence deserves serious consideration. Its balance of indoor comfort, generous outdoor living and highly desirable location makes it equally appealing as a permanent home, holiday retreat or long-term investment within the Costa Blanca property market.\n\nProperty Features\n\nFive-bedroom villa arranged over two floors\n\nAlmost flat plot exceeding 1,200m²\n\nPrivate kidney-shaped swimming pool\n\nFive bedrooms and three bathrooms\n\nOpen-plan fitted kitchen with adjoining storage room\n\nQuiet residential setting in Paichi\n\nShort drive to Moraira town centre\n\nClose to Playa de l'Ampolla and the marina\n\nMultiple sun terraces with open views\n\nLow-maintenance Mediterranean gardens with two independent entrances and extensive parking\n\nDiscover the Lifestyle of Paichi and Moraira\n\nPaichi is one of Moraira's well-established residential areas, appreciated for its peaceful surroundings while remaining conveniently close to the vibrant town centre. Within just a few minutes, residents can enjoy the marina, boutique shopping, cafés, restaurants and the relaxed atmosphere that has made Moraira one of the Costa Blanca's most desirable destinations.\n\nThe nearby coastline offers a selection of sandy beaches and picturesque coves with clear Mediterranean waters, ideal for swimming, paddleboarding or simply enjoying the scenery throughout the year. This combination of tranquillity, accessibility and quality of life continues to make real estate in Moraira highly sought after by both international and Spanish buyers.",
