    description: "Contemporary Mediterranean Living Within Walking Distance of Moraira Centre\n\nPerfectly positioned just a short stroll from the heart of Moraira and the sandy shores of Playa de l'Ampolla, this exceptional newly completed villa combines sophisticated contemporary design with outstanding comfort and functionality. Set on a south-facing plot enjoying open sea views, the property has been finished to an exceptional standard and is offered fully furnished, providing a turnkey opportunity in one of the Costa Blanca's most desirable locations.\n\nElegant Design Created for Modern Living\n\nDesigned to embrace the Mediterranean lifestyle, the villa offers bright, open interiors that flow effortlessly onto expansive outdoor terraces. Floor-to-ceiling glazing floods the principal living areas with natural light while framing views across the swimming pool towards the sea.\n\nThe spacious open-plan lounge and dining area connect seamlessly to a designer kitchen, fitted with premium integrated appliances, stone worktops and generous preparation space, making it equally suited to everyday family living and entertaining guests.\n\nThe principal suite enjoys direct access to the pool terrace and features a luxurious en-suite bathroom together with two independent walk-in dressing areas positioned discreetly behind the sleeping area. Two additional guest bedrooms each benefit from fitted wardrobes and private en-suite bathrooms, while a further room provides flexibility as a home office or fourth bedroom.\n\nA practical laundry room with bespoke cabinetry and additional storage completes the accommodation.\n\nExceptional Outdoor Living\n\nThe outdoor spaces have been designed as a natural extension of the home. A spectacular 10-metre swimming pool forms the centrepiece of the south-facing terrace, surrounded by generous areas for sunbathing and outdoor relaxation.\n\nAdjacent to the pool, a fully equipped summer kitchen and barbecue pavilion includes a sink, dishwasher, fridge-freezer, gas hob, grill and stone worktops, allowing effortless outdoor entertaining throughout the year. For added convenience, the pool area also benefits from an exterior shower and separate guest bathroom.\n\nThe landscaped gardens are fully enclosed, providing privacy and security, while two separate motorised entrances give access to generous parking facilities including a double garage and a covered double carport.\n\nBuilt for Comfort, Efficiency and Everyday Convenience\n\nConstructed using quality materials and equipped with modern technology, the villa has been designed for comfortable year-round living. Features include underfloor heating powered by an energy-efficient Panasonic heat pump, fully integrated air conditioning, porcelain flooring throughout, motorised window shutters and fibre-optic internet wiring to every room.\n\nAdditional features such as disabled-friendly access between levels, extensive built-in storage, pre-installation for a fireplace in the living room and high-quality bespoke finishes further enhance the property's appeal.\n\nWhether you are searching for a new build villa for sale in Moraira, a modern sea view home within walking distance of the town centre, or a luxury villa close to Playa de l'Ampolla, this outstanding residence offers an exceptional combination of location, design and lifestyle.\n\nProperty Features\n\nSouth-facing orientation with beautiful sea views\n\nWalking distance to Moraira town centre and Playa de l'Ampolla\n\nSpacious open-plan living and dining area\n\nDesigner kitchen with premium integrated appliances\n\nFour bedrooms, including a luxurious principal suite\n\nThree en-suite bathrooms plus guest cloakroom\n\n10-metre private swimming pool\n\nFully equipped outdoor kitchen and barbecue pavilion\n\nExterior shower and poolside guest bathroom\n\nUnderfloor heating via Panasonic heat pump\n\nMotorised windows shutters\n\nFibre-optic internet installed throughout the property\n\nLaundry room with fitted storage\n\nDouble garage plus covered double carport\n\nArea Guide – Moraira\n\nMoraira is one of the Costa Blanca's most prestigious seaside towns, renowned for its relaxed Mediterranean lifestyle, beautiful beaches and exclusive residential neighbourhoods. The villa enjoys a prime location within walking distance of Playa de l'Ampolla, Moraira's largest sandy beach, as well as the marina, boutique shops, cafés and an outstanding selection of international restaurants.\n\nDespite its popularity, Moraira has retained the charm of a traditional fishing village while offering modern amenities, excellent healthcare, international schools nearby and easy access to Alicante and Valencia airports. The surrounding coastline is home to picturesque coves, scenic walking trails and championship golf courses, making the area particularly attractive for both permanent living and luxury holiday homes.\n\nFor buyers seeking a luxury villa for sale in Moraira, a modern home with sea views, or a new build property within walking distance of the beach and town centre, this residence represents an outstanding opportunity in one of Spain's most desirable coastal destinations.",
