    description: "This modern new-build villa is currently under construction in the sought-after area of Moravit, Moraira, within easy walking distance of shops, supermarkets, restaurants and the beach. Set on a generous south-facing plot of almost 1,000 m², the villa is designed as a practical and contemporary single-level home, with high-quality materials and finishes throughout. Completion is expected in the second quarter of 2027, offering the opportunity to purchase a brand-new property and make it your own from the start. The property features a spacious and bright open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen with a central island and a guest toilet. The sleeping accommodation is located separately, with two generous bedrooms sharing a modern bathroom. At the end of the hallway, the master bedroom benefits from a private en-suite bathroom. The south-facing orientation ensures plenty of natural light, while the neutral colour palette and timeless materials create a stylish and welcoming atmosphere. With parking for two cars and an excellent location close to both amenities and the coast, this villa would make an ideal permanent residence, holiday home or investment. Key features: Excellent location within walking distance of amenities and the beach Single-storey villa 3 bedrooms 2 bathrooms plus guest toilet Open-plan living and dining area Fully fitted kitchen with island Parking for 2 cars South-facing High-quality finishes Currently under construction, completion expected for summer 2027 Contact us today for further information about this exciting new-build property in Moraira.",
