    plot: 635,
    description: "Sea View Villa for Sale in El Portet, Moraira, Costa Blanca\n\nJust 200 metres from the sought-after beach area of El Portet, this beautifully renovated five-bedroom Mediterranean villa combines a highly desirable coastal setting with strong established rental performance. Positioned on a quiet residential road with no through traffic, the property enjoys sea views, excellent privacy and the convenience of having the beach, restaurants and local amenities within an easy walk.\n\nThe villa is sold fully furnished and equipped on a turnkey basis and benefits from a tourist licence. The current owner reports net rental revenue of approximately €70,000 per year, making this an interesting proposition for buyers seeking a property in one of Moraira's most established holiday locations, whether as an investment, second home or combination of both.\n\nProperty Features\n\nFive-bedroom Mediterranean villa with sea views\n\nApproximately 260 m² of accommodation arranged over two floors\n\nTourist licence with established rental income\n\nOnly approximately 200 metres from El Portet beach area\n\nPrivate swimming pool with heat pump for heating and cooling\n\nFully air-conditioned with radiator heating pre-installation\n\nLarge covered terraces and private garden areas\n\nPoolside barbecue house and rooftop solarium with sea views\n\nTwo gated parking areas with off-road parking for several vehicles\n\nWalking distance to restaurants, tapas bars, grocery shop and water sports in El Portet\n\nProperty Distribution\n\nThe villa provides approximately 260 m² of accommodation across two floors connected by an internal staircase. The upper level sits at the same level as the swimming pool and forms the principal living area. It comprises an open-plan living and dining room with a fully equipped kitchen, together with covered dining porches to both the front and rear. The living area opens directly onto a generous covered terrace overlooking the gardens.\n\nAlso on this floor are three double bedrooms and a shared bathroom.\n\nThe internal staircase leads to the lower level, where a hallway provides access to two further double bedrooms and two bathrooms. One of these bedrooms has its own en-suite bathroom and a private terrace opening towards the gardens. This floor also incorporates a garage, a substantial storage room and an additional room suitable for keeping private belongings while the property is being rented.\n\nFull Property Details\n\nRenovated with care while retaining its traditional Spanish and Mediterranean character, the villa is presented in a fully furnished and equipped condition. Its layout is particularly well suited to both private use and holiday rental, with five double bedrooms distributed across the two floors and several outdoor areas providing space to dine, relax and enjoy the setting.\n\nThe main living space features air conditioning, ceiling fans and a fireplace, while heating infrastructure has been pre-installed for radiators. Outside, the private swimming pool is surrounded by generous sun terraces and benefits from a heat pump capable of both heating and cooling the water.\n\nA separate poolside barbecue house adds a practical outdoor entertaining area, while the covered rooftop solarium provides an elevated chill-out space with impressive sea views. Two gated parking areas offer off-road parking for multiple vehicles, an important practical benefit in this popular coastal location.\n\nWith its tourist licence, established rental history, five bedrooms, private pool and proximity to El Portet, this is a particularly versatile property for sale in Moraira Costa Blanca.\n\nEl Portet Lifestyle and Coastal Setting\n\nEl Portet is one of the best-known beach areas around Moraira, centred around a sandy beach of almost 400 metres with shallow turquoise waters. The immediate area combines the beach with seaside tapas bars, four quality restaurants, a small grocery shop and activities including kayaking and stand-up paddleboarding.\n\nFrom El Portet, the maritime footpath provides a pleasant coastal route towards Moraira, passing the Cala Portitxolet cove and continuing towards the marina. The combination of a walkable beach setting, established amenities and access to Moraira makes El Portet particularly attractive to both Spanish and international property buyers.\n\nFor buyers considering real estate in El Portet, this five-bedroom villa offers the additional benefit of an existing tourist licence and reported rental performance, alongside the flexibility to enjoy the property personally.\n\nOur team is available to guide you through each stage of purchasing property in Spain. If you would like further information about this villa, its rental potential or to arrange a private viewing, please contact us.",
