    plot: 2740,
    description: "Sea View Villa for Sale in Moraira with Double Plot\n\nSet within one of Moraira’s sought-after residential settings, this renovated four-bedroom villa combines Mediterranean character with a more contemporary Ibiza-inspired style. The property occupies a 1,379 m² main plot, accompanied by an adjoining 1,360 m² second plot, giving a total of approximately 2,740 m² of land. Together, the two plots create an unusually private environment with very little overlooking from neighbouring properties.\n\nWith 196 m² of built area, the villa is designed around outdoor living, with bright interiors opening towards generous terraces, a heated swimming pool and attractive sea views. Its location is equally appealing, with the beaches approximately five minutes away and Moraira town centre only a few minutes by car.\n\nProperty Features\n\nFour-bedroom renovated Mediterranean villa\n\nSea views towards the Mediterranean and Moraira\n\nTwo adjoining plots totalling approximately 2,740 m²\n\nHeated swimming pool with extensive terraces\n\nSummer kitchen and generous barbecue area\n\nMoraira beaches approximately 5 minutes away\n\nMoraira town centre only a few minutes away\n\nCovered parking for two vehicles\n\nPeaceful and private setting with limited overlooking\n\nPotential for approximately 440 m² total buildability on the main plot, subject to planning regulations\n\nProperty Distribution\n\nThe villa provides approximately 196 m² of built area arranged over two levels. The principal level contains the main living spaces and three bedrooms, all with direct access to the exterior. The upper floor is dedicated to the master suite, which incorporates a private bathroom and dressing room.\n\nThe property is surrounded by substantial outdoor areas, including terraces, lounge and dining spaces, shaded seating areas and a heated swimming pool. Covered parking is provided for two vehicles, with scope to enlarge the parking area if required.\n\nFull Property Details\n\nThe appeal of this Moraira property lies in the way its traditional Mediterranean character has been refreshed without losing its sense of place. Originally conceived in a Spanish style, the villa has been comprehensively renovated with a relaxed aesthetic influenced by Ibiza, creating a home that feels equally suited to permanent living and holidays.\n\nInside, the accommodation is bright and practical, with the principal living areas positioned to make the most of the connection with the terraces and surrounding landscape. Reversible air conditioning is installed throughout for year-round comfort.\n\nThe outdoor areas form a major part of the property. A spacious terrace surrounds the heated swimming pool, while several separate seating and dining areas provide flexibility throughout the day. A dedicated summer kitchen and substantial barbecue area create an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining.\n\nSet beneath the surrounding trees, an elevated chill-out area offers a quieter place to relax away from the main terrace. In the evening, the outlook changes as the lights of Moraira appear across the landscape. The elevated position also provides an opportunity to enjoy Moraira’s famous firework displays from the comfort of home.\n\nA particularly important advantage is the adjoining second plot. The main plot measures approximately 1,379 m², while the additional plot extends to approximately 1,360 m². Both are included in the sale, helping to protect the property's sense of openness and privacy.\n\nFor buyers considering future development, the main plot offers total buildability of up to approximately 440 m², subject to applicable planning regulations. Architect-prepared extension plans are available and demonstrate potential ways the property could be enlarged or adapted. This provides an attractive combination of immediate usability and longer-term flexibility.\n\nMediterranean Living in Moraira\n\nFor buyers searching for a property for sale in Moraira, Costa Blanca, this villa offers a distinctive combination of sea views, privacy, outdoor space and proximity to the town and beaches. The surrounding setting provides a peaceful base while keeping Moraira’s amenities within easy reach.\n\nThe beaches are approximately five minutes away, with Moraira centre only a few minutes away. Alicante Airport can be reached in around one hour, while Valencia and Valencia Airport are approximately one hour and 20 minutes away.\n\nFor those exploring real estate in Moraira, the combination of two adjoining plots, a renovated four-bedroom villa, a heated pool and potential future expansion makes this a particularly versatile opportunity in the Costa Blanca North property market.",
