    built: 424,
    plot: 940,
    description: "Newly Built Five-Bedroom Villa with Guest Apartment\n\nSet high within Cumbre del Sol, this newly completed detached villa presents an impressive combination of contemporary architecture, panoramic Mediterranean views and flexible accommodation. Completed in 2025, the property has been designed around natural light, privacy and the relationship between the interior and the surrounding landscape. From its elevated position, the outlook extends across the Benitachell coastline and El Portet, along the coast from Moraira towards Calpe, with the Peñón de Ifach, Far de Albir and Sierra Bernia forming part of the wider panorama.\n\nThe accommodation is equally well suited to family life, entertaining or welcoming guests. The main residence includes three bedrooms, a dramatic double-height living and dining area, a modern kitchen with central island and a generous master suite with walk-in dressing room and private balcony terrace. An independently accessed two-bedroom guest apartment adds considerable versatility, while the private swimming pool, extensive terraces, lift and double parking complete a highly practical modern home.\n\nProperty Features\n\nNewly built detached villa completed in 2025\n\nFive bedrooms, including a two-bedroom independently accessed guest apartment\n\nPanoramic private swimming pool overlooking the Mediterranean and mountains\n\nDouble-height living and dining area with floor-to-ceiling windows\n\nModern kitchen with central island and separate master suite with dressing room\n\nLift providing convenient access throughout the property\n\nSpacious terraces designed around the pool and outdoor living areas\n\nSolar panels and high-quality sustainable building materials\n\nOutdoor shower and separate exterior WC\n\nClose to international schooling, beaches, shops, Moraira and Benitachell\n\nProperty Distribution\n\nThe property provides five bedrooms in total and is arranged to offer both private family accommodation and independent guest space. The main residence contains three bedrooms, including the master suite with walk-in dressing room and private balcony terrace. The principal living level centres on a spacious open-plan living and dining area with an impressive double-height ceiling and a contemporary kitchen with a central island.\n\nThe property also includes a separate two-bedroom guest apartment with its own independent access. A lift enhances accessibility between the levels, while outside there are extensive terraces, a private swimming pool and a double parking area.\n\nFull Property Details\n\nCompleted in 2025, this contemporary villa has been conceived as a modern Mediterranean home where the architecture makes full use of its elevated setting. Large floor-to-ceiling windows draw natural light deep into the interiors while framing the extensive sea and mountain views.\n\nThe principal living space makes a strong impression with its double-height ceiling and generous proportions. The adjoining modern kitchen with central island creates a natural social hub, while the carefully planned connection to the terraces allows everyday living to extend outdoors.\n\nThe three-bedroom main residence includes a well-proportioned master suite with a walk-in dressing room and private balcony terrace. For visitors or extended family, the independently accessed two-bedroom apartment provides a useful degree of separation and flexibility.\n\nOutside, the private pool takes centre stage, surrounded by terraces that provide several areas for relaxing, dining and enjoying the views. The elevated position creates a particularly private setting, with the Mediterranean and surrounding mountains providing the backdrop. An outdoor shower and separate exterior WC add further practicality to the pool area.\n\nThe specification includes a lift, solar panels and sustainable, high-quality construction materials. Combined with the modern design and generous glazing, these features create a home that has been planned with comfort, accessibility and energy efficiency in mind.\n\nElevated Coastal Living in Cumbre del Sol\n\nCumbre del Sol is one of the established residential areas of the Northern Costa Blanca, offering elevated positions overlooking the Mediterranean while remaining within reach of the region's coastal towns. From this villa, the international school is just a few minutes away by car, shopping facilities are around five minutes away, and both Moraira and Benitachell can be reached in approximately ten minutes. Cala del Moraig is also around ten minutes by car.\n\nThe surrounding area offers beaches and secluded coves, restaurants, supermarkets and everyday amenities, alongside opportunities for hiking and cycling. Golf courses and sports facilities are within easy reach, while Moraira and Jávea provide further restaurants, boutiques, marinas and leisure options. Alicante and Valencia international airports provide wider connections.\n\nFor buyers researching property for sale in Cumbre del Sol Costa Blanca, this villa stands out for its elevated position, panoramic outlook, five-bedroom configuration, independent guest accommodation and modern specification. It offers a compelling option as a permanent family home, second residence or long-term investment in Northern Costa Blanca real estate.\n\nInterested in discovering the property in person? Contact our team for further details, current availability, or to arrange a private viewing. We are here to guide you through every stage of purchasing your home in Spain.",
