    description: "Contemporary Villa for Sale in Baladrar, Benissa Coast\n\nModern Sea View Home Overlooking the Prestigious San Jaime Golf Course\n\nPerfectly positioned in the highly desirable Baladrar residential area, this elegant contemporary villa enjoys a privileged setting overlooking the renowned San Jaime Golf Course while offering beautiful Mediterranean Sea views. Combining sophisticated modern architecture, generous living spaces and a location within walking distance of the beach, restaurants and Ifach Golf Club, this exceptional property is ideal for those seeking a luxury villa for sale on the Benissa Coast.\n\nContemporary Architecture Designed Around Light and Views\n\nThe villa has been thoughtfully designed over two levels to maximise natural light and create a seamless connection between the interior and the surrounding landscape. Large floor-to-ceiling sliding doors frame uninterrupted views across the lush fairways of the San Jaime Golf Course, extending towards the Mediterranean Sea and creating an ever-changing backdrop throughout the day.\n\nThe entrance level features an impressive open-plan living and dining room with a stylish, fully equipped kitchen, creating an elegant yet comfortable space for everyday living and entertaining. The adjoining covered terrace becomes a natural extension of the interior, offering the perfect setting for outdoor dining while enjoying the peaceful golf course setting and distant sea views.\n\nTwo spacious guest suites are also located on this floor, each benefiting from fitted wardrobes and its own beautifully appointed en-suite bathroom, together with a guest cloakroom.\n\nPrivate Principal Suite with Direct Pool Access\n\nOccupying the lower level, the generous principal suite has been designed as a private retreat. Full-height sliding doors open directly onto the sun terrace and swimming pool, allowing indoor and outdoor living to blend effortlessly. The suite also includes fitted wardrobes and an elegant en-suite bathroom.\n\nThis level also incorporates a practical laundry room together with a versatile additional room that can easily be adapted as a home office, gym, hobby room, wine cellar or occasional guest bedroom, offering flexibility for changing lifestyle requirements.\n\nOutdoor Living Beside the San Jaime Golf Course\n\nDesigned for enjoying the Costa Blanca's exceptional climate, the outdoor spaces offer complete privacy and multiple areas for relaxation throughout the year. The private swimming pool is surrounded by expansive terraces with ample space for sun loungers, while covered seating areas provide welcome shade during the warmer months.\n\nBeautifully landscaped Mediterranean gardens with mature palm trees enhance the tranquil atmosphere and frame the exceptional outlook across the fairways of the prestigious San Jaime Golf Course. Whether enjoying breakfast on the terrace or watching the sunset over the Mediterranean, the setting offers a rare combination of golf, sea and nature.\n\nA secure automatic entrance gate provides access to private off-road parking together with a covered carport conveniently positioned close to the main entrance.\n\nModern Comfort with Energy-Efficient Features\n\nBuilt for year-round comfort, the villa is equipped with air conditioning throughout, electric underfloor heating, solar panels, an integrated alarm system and quality modern finishes. Every element has been selected to provide a comfortable, low-maintenance lifestyle while improving energy efficiency.\n\nOffering contemporary architecture, panoramic golf course views and a prime coastal location, this property represents an outstanding opportunity for buyers searching for a modern villa for sale in Baladrar, a contemporary home overlooking San Jaime Golf Course, or a luxury property on the Benissa Coast close to the beach and Ifach Golf Club.\n\nProperty Highlights\n\nContemporary villa overlooking the prestigious San Jaime Golf Course\n\nBeautiful Mediterranean Sea views\n\nWalking distance to Baladrar Beach\n\nShort walk to Ifach Golf Club\n\nThree spacious bedrooms with luxury en-suite bathrooms\n\nBright open-plan living area with floor-to-ceiling glazing\n\nDesigner fully equipped kitchen\n\nPrivate swimming pool with extensive sun terraces\n\nLandscaped Mediterranean gardens with mature palms\n\nFlexible room suitable as an office, gym or guest bedroom\n\nAir conditioning throughout\n\nElectric underfloor heating\n\nSolar panels\n\nIntegrated alarm system\n\nGated private parking with covered carport\n\nArea Guide – Baladrar & San Jaime Golf, Benissa Coast\n\nBaladrar is one of the Benissa Coast's most prestigious residential neighbourhoods, favoured for its peaceful atmosphere, beautiful coastline and excellent accessibility. The picturesque Cala Baladrar, famous for its crystal-clear waters and relaxed beachfront restaurant, is only a short walk away and forms part of the spectacular coastal path connecting the coves of Benissa and neighbouring Moraira.\n\nThe villa enjoys an exceptional position overlooking the prestigious San Jaime Golf Course, home to the well-established Ifach Golf Club. This attractive nine-hole course is surrounded by mature pine trees and Mediterranean landscaping, offering year-round golf together with a welcoming clubhouse, restaurant and social facilities. Properties overlooking San Jaime Golf Course remain highly sought after due to their open green views, tranquillity and close proximity to the coast.\n\nEveryday amenities, including supermarkets, cafés and restaurants, are all within walking distance, while the vibrant centres of Moraira and Calpe can be reached in less than ten minutes by car. Both towns offer marinas, sandy beaches, boutique shopping and an excellent selection of international dining.\n\nFor buyers seeking modern villas for sale in Baladrar, contemporary properties overlooking San Jaime Golf Course, or luxury homes on the Benissa Coast with sea and golf views, this location offers one of the finest lifestyle opportunities on the Costa Blanca.",
