    description: "A Contemporary Mediterranean Residence with Panoramic Coastal Views\n\nBeautifully renovated luxury villa for sale in La\n\nArnella, Moraira, offering panoramic sea, mountain and Peñón de Ifach views.\n\nSet on a private plot just five minutes from the town centre, this exceptional\n\nhome features five bedrooms, premium finishes, a private pool, sauna, gym and\n\ndouble garage.\n\nOccupying a privileged position in the sought-after\n\nresidential area of La Arnella, this beautifully renovated villa enjoys\n\nsweeping views across the Mediterranean coastline, the iconic Peñón de Ifach\n\nand the surrounding mountain landscape. Offering complete privacy on an 878 m²\n\nplot, the property is just a short five-minute drive from the heart of Moraira,\n\nits marina, boutiques and beaches.\n\nOriginally constructed in 2008, the villa underwent a\n\ncomprehensive, high-specification renovation in 2024, transforming it into an\n\nelegant contemporary residence where quality craftsmanship and sophisticated\n\ndesign are evident throughout. Extending to approximately 375 m² over three\n\nfloors, the interiors combine natural textures with carefully selected black\n\nand gold detailing, creating a warm yet refined atmosphere.\n\nThe home has been equipped with every modern comfort,\n\nincluding underfloor heating, air conditioning throughout, solar panels, an\n\nAsistel alarm system with video entry, exterior surveillance cameras and\n\nelectric shutters in every bedroom and bathroom, providing year-round comfort,\n\nenergy efficiency and security.\n\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully arranged to\n\nmaximise both privacy and functionality. The lower floor features two spacious\n\ndouble bedrooms, each with its own en-suite shower room, together with a\n\ngenerous studio-style living space incorporating a fully fitted kitchen and\n\noffice. This versatile area can easily be adapted into an additional bedroom or\n\nindependent guest accommodation.\n\nThe principal living space occupies the middle floor,\n\nwhere a welcoming entrance hall leads to an impressive open-plan interior. A\n\ncontemporary kitchen with breakfast island, walk-in pantry and separate utility\n\nroom flows naturally into the dining area and elegant lounge, centred around a\n\nmodern electric fireplace. Expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing fills the space\n\nwith natural light and opens directly onto the sun terrace, where covered and\n\nopen seating areas surround the private swimming pool. An outdoor solar-heated\n\nshower enhances the poolside experience, while a fully equipped outdoor gym\n\nwith sauna creates a private wellness retreat. A guest cloakroom completes this\n\nlevel.\n\nThe upper floor is reserved for the luxurious principal\n\nsuite, offering fitted wardrobes on both sides of the room and a beautifully\n\ndesigned en-suite bathroom featuring twin walk-in showers and a heated towel\n\nrail. A further double bedroom with its own en-suite bathroom provides\n\nexcellent accommodation for family or visiting guests.\n\nPractical features include a spacious double garage with\n\nautomated roller doors and an additional entrance providing convenient access\n\nto the property.\n\nCombining panoramic sea views, exceptional privacy,\n\nluxurious finishes and an outstanding specification, this remarkable villa\n\nperfectly captures the essence of contemporary Mediterranean living. A rare\n\nopportunity to acquire an exceptional home in one of Moraira's most desirable\n\nresidential locations.\n\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or to request further\n\ninformation.",
