    description: "Contemporary Mediterranean Villa for Sale Near Moraira\n\nA newly built designer villa near Moraira offering refined contemporary living across three levels, with four en-suite bedrooms, panoramic sea views, an infinity pool, double garage and a versatile 165 m² lower-ground floor.\n\nSet within one of the Costa Blanca’s most exclusive residential areas, this striking new-build villa brings together clean contemporary architecture, generous proportions and the relaxed rhythm of Mediterranean living. Its position close to Moraira and its exceptional beaches places both the coastline and the town within the character of the property’s lifestyle offering.\n\nDesigned for owners who enjoy spending time with family and friends, the home balances open communal spaces with carefully considered private accommodation. Natural light, expansive terraces and a strong relationship between the interiors and outdoors give the residence an effortless sense of space.\n\nFor buyers considering a property for sale in Moraira, the appeal lies not only in its modern aesthetic, but in the way the accommodation has been arranged for everyday life, entertaining and year-round use.\n\nDesigned around modern Mediterranean living\n\nThe principal living spaces occupy the ground floor, where a generous open-plan sitting and dining area creates the social heart of the home. Large, light-filled interiors flow into a contemporary kitchen centred around a substantial island, providing a practical setting for relaxed breakfasts, family meals or evenings with guests.\n\nThree bedrooms are also positioned on this level, each benefiting from its own private bathroom. This arrangement gives family members or visitors a comfortable degree of independence, while a separate guest cloakroom adds further convenience to the main living floor.\n\nThe layout has been conceived with a clear emphasis on connection. Rather than separating entertaining and accommodation, the ground floor creates a natural sequence between cooking, dining, relaxing and enjoying the outdoor spaces.\n\nA private master retreat above the living spaces\n\nThe first floor is reserved for the principal suite, creating a more secluded setting away from the remaining bedrooms. The master bedroom incorporates a dedicated dressing area and an elegant private bathroom, while direct access leads to a panoramic terrace.\n\nHere, the outlook becomes a defining feature of the property. Views extend towards the sea and the surrounding natural landscape, creating a private setting in which to begin the day or unwind at the end of it.\n\nThe master suite therefore functions as more than simply a bedroom; it is a distinct private retreat within the wider architectural composition of the villa.\n\nFlexible space with considerable potential\n\nOne of the property's notable advantages is its substantial 165 m² lower-ground level. In addition to a two-car garage, laundry room and bathroom, this floor includes an open-plan additional space that can be adapted according to the owner's requirements.\n\nIts generous dimensions allow for a range of possible uses, including a private cinema, sauna, gym or guest accommodation. The flexibility of this floor makes the villa particularly suited to buyers looking for more than conventional bedroom and living space, while allowing the eventual owner to shape the property around their own lifestyle.\n\nThe double garage provides secure parking within the property, while the additional utility and bathroom facilities make this level practical as well as versatile.\n\nOutdoor living and year-round comfort\n\nThe exterior has been designed to complement the villa's contemporary character, with an infinity pool providing a natural focal point for outdoor relaxation. Combined with the property's elevated panoramic outlook, the pool creates an inviting setting for enjoying the Mediterranean climate.\n\nInside, underfloor heating and air conditioning provide comfort throughout the year, making the residence suitable not only as a summer retreat but also as a permanent home. The combination of modern climate control, generous accommodation and adaptable additional space supports a lifestyle that can evolve with the needs of its owners.\n\nThis balance between architectural simplicity and practical functionality is central to the property's appeal. The villa has the presence expected of a contemporary luxury property in Moraira, while its layout remains firmly focused on comfortable everyday living.\n\nProperty Features\n\nNew-build contemporary villa near Moraira\n\nFour bedrooms, each with a private en-suite bathroom\n\nMaster suite with dressing room, luxury bathroom and panoramic sea-view terrace\n\nOpen-plan living and dining area with modern kitchen and central island\n\nInfinity swimming pool for Mediterranean outdoor living\n\n165 m² lower-ground floor with flexible open-plan space\n\nDouble garage with dedicated laundry room and additional bathroom\n\nUnderfloor heating for year-round interior comfort\n\nAir conditioning throughout the property\n\nLocation close to Moraira and its beaches, within an exclusive residential area\n\nThe Moraira lifestyle\n\nFor those exploring real estate in Moraira, location is naturally an important part of the decision. This villa is positioned close to Moraira and its beaches, within an established description of the area as one of the Costa Blanca's most exclusive residential settings.\n\nThe property is particularly well suited to buyers seeking a villa for sale in Moraira that can accommodate both private family life and entertaining. Its four en-suite bedrooms provide a strong foundation for hosting guests, while the open-plan living spaces encourage time spent together.\n\nThe relationship with the sea is another important element. From the master suite's panoramic terrace, the outlook towards the sea and surrounding natural landscape adds a distinctive sense of place without compromising the home's contemporary character.\n\nMoraira's appeal is also reflected in the property's overall design philosophy: sophisticated architecture combined with the pleasures of Mediterranean outdoor living. The infinity pool, terraces and generous internal spaces create a home intended to be enjoyed rather than simply admired.\n\nFor an international purchaser searching for a luxury property in Moraira, this residence offers a considered combination of contemporary design, substantial accommodation and adaptable space. The lower-ground floor is particularly useful for those who want to introduce dedicated leisure facilities, a private cinema, wellness area or additional guest accommodation, subject to the owner's chosen configuration.\n\nAt the same time, the main accommodation remains practical and welcoming. The ground-floor bedrooms offer easy access and privacy for guests, while the separate master suite provides a quieter upper-level retreat.\n\nAs a property for sale in Moraira, this villa is therefore distinguished by its versatility as much as its design. It can serve as a sophisticated second home on the Costa Blanca or as a permanent residence designed around family, entertaining and outdoor living.\n\nWith its contemporary architecture, four en-suite bedrooms, panoramic sea outlook, infinity pool, double garage and substantial flexible lower-ground floor, the villa presents a modern interpretation of Mediterranean residential life close to Moraira's coastline.",
